```php
<?php
$term = urlencode("COVID-19 mental health prevalence");
$url = "https://eutils.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/entrez/eutils/esearch.fcgi?db=pubmed&term=$term&retmax=20&retmode=json";
$data = json_decode(file_get_contents($url), true);
print_r($data['esearchresult']['idlist']);
```

You'd then fetch abstracts with `efetch` and parse them. For structured data, Our World in Data offers CSV downloads you can read with `fgetcsv()`.

